# Headset session 11, launch 1 of 2 (lane Q, frame/perf/session-h11/README.md): hypothesis A. Every frame
# whose only layer would be the projection (races, loading) also gets a tiny fully transparent quad layer
# (16x16, 1 cm, 2 m ahead, alpha blended), so SteamVR never composites a projection layer alone, as in
# KartFrame's menus and in GalaxyFrame (both clean). The first-write barrier stays Dawn's own.
# Routine: menus, then a Time Trial; head turns during the countdown (standing still), then driving.
KARTFRAME_RACE_QUAD=1
KARTFRAME_FIRST_WRITE_BARRIER=dawn
KARTFRAME_FRAME_LOG=1
KARTFRAME_RECORD=raw
KARTFRAME_SESSION_ENV_ONCE=1
